==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ryu (Enemy)|Ryu]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Chun-Li (Enemy)|Chun-Li]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The enemies in this stage have low magnification, so it shouldn't be too much of a problem. Don't forget to have some ranged units to deal with Ryu and Chun-Li.

